              "title": "ＪＡ全農ふくれんpresents　水と緑の物語  ～Ｄｉｓｃｏｖｅｒ！～(1)",
              "url": "https://kbc.co.jp/r-radio/radio_watergreen/",
              "failed_record": "0",
              "ts_in_ng": "0",
